  <!-- ═══ NOTIFICATIONS ═══ -->
  <div class="section-label">Notifications</div>
  <h2>Who Gets Notified and When</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="notif-row">
      <div class="notif-icon" style="background:var(--green-lt);">🏠</div>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>Resident — Visitor Recognised at Door</h3>
        <p>When a panel sends a successful <code>passEvent</code> for a visitor's synced face, the inviting resident is notified. Frequency configurable per condo: every time / first time per day / once only.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notif-row">
      <div class="notif-icon" style="background:var(--red-lt);">⚠️</div>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>Property Management — Panel Stopped Working</h3>
        <p>If a panel's heartbeat (<code>heartSync</code>) is missed beyond <code>heartbeat_time</code> minutes, an email is sent to <code>heartbeat_email</code> using the "Meet Panel Stopped Working" template.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notif-row">
      <div class="notif-icon" style="background:var(--green-lt);">✅</div>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>Property Management — Panel Recovered</h3>
        <p>When the panel resumes sending heartbeats, "Meet Panel Start Working" email is sent and <code>last_panel_restart_on</code> is updated.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="notif-row">
      <div class="notif-icon" style="background:var(--blue-lt);">🔔</div>
      <div class="text">
        <h3>Resident — Incoming Intercom Call</h3>
        <p>When a visitor presses the call button at the panel, a SIP-based video call is routed to the resident's app (unless DND is enabled via <code>meetmecallrecieveaction</code>).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

