  <!-- ═══ SECURITY FEATURES ═══ -->
  <div class="section-label">Security</div>
  <h2>Security &amp; Access Control Features</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="security-grid">
      <div class="sec-item purple">
        <h4>Time-Bound Access</h4>
        <p>Every face synced to a panel is tied to a time zone / date range. Visitor and staff access auto-expires — the face is removed from the panel via <code>deleteFace</code> when the window ends.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-item blue">
        <h4>Token-Based MQTT Calls</h4>
        <p>Each MQTT command carries a <code>token</code> with a <code>token_status</code> (Valid/Used) to prevent replay and track command lifecycle, plus <code>request_attempt</code> for retry handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-item green">
        <h4>Unified Access Groups</h4>
        <p><code>common_access_group</code> lets a single access policy span multiple hardware types (Hikvision FR, Meet FR, virtual buttons) — consistent permissions across systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sec-item amber">
        <h4>Heartbeat Monitoring</h4>
        <p>Panels are continuously monitored. A missed heartbeat triggers an alert before residents notice the door isn't working — proactive maintenance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

